# Work-only paths: tracked on develop (and feature branches), never on master.
#
# master is the production branch and carries only the framework core. It is
# produced from develop by scripts/release-to-master.sh, which removes every
# path below from the snapshot. .githooks/pre-commit blocks committing them on
# master. One git pathspec per line (glob / exclude magic allowed); blank lines
# and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# READMEs stay on master so the folder conventions remain documented for
# consumers (and AGENTS.md links keep resolving).

:(glob)docs/specs/**
:(exclude)docs/specs/README.md

:(glob)docs/context/*/**

:(glob)docs/reports/**
:(exclude)docs/reports/README.md

:(glob)docs/plans/**
:(exclude)docs/plans/README.md

:(glob)docs/decisions/0*.md
docs/decisions/INDEX.md
